     18  0bad
     19  0bad							; Does the MIDI chip's interrupt reach the C64? (v0.16) Ask for one (the
     20  0bad							; transmit-empty interrupt asks at once) with the timer quiet: if it comes,
     21  0bad							; the MIDI chip interrupts when a byte comes in or can go out (IrqMidi) and
     22  0bad							; the timer only ticks the ms. If not, poll it 4000 times a second (Irq) as
     23  0bad							; before. Interrupts are off when this is called.
     24  0bad				   MidiIrqTest
