    513  673c							; SHIFT + /: roll the patch. Each effect the dice use (efDice) goes on with
    514  673c							; its chance, its settings anywhere in their dice ranges; or off. v0.39: the
    515  673c							; envelope's settings are rolled too (efDice 2). The tone, levels and octaves
    516  673c							; stay. The name gets a *. C= + / undoes it.
