    360  6e1b							; CRSR DOWN or CRSR RIGHT (A = 1 / 2: which) pressed, ONE KEY PLAY on: the
    361  6e1b							; phrase's next step sounds. PENTATONIC PAIRS: two notes of the key's
    362  6e1b							; pentatonic scale, one apart (a third or a fourth), across the overlay's two
    363  6e1b							; octaves. CHORD NOTES: one note of the chord (the keys held or latched),
    364  6e1b							; over two octaves. EACH PRESS CUTS the last step or lets it RING ON (until
    365  6e1b							; the next). The notes sound while either key is down (latch: until the next
    366  6e1b							; press).
